Navigation|Ctrl+H|Navigate left (nvim split / herdr pane)
Navigation|Ctrl+J|Navigate down (nvim split / herdr pane)
Navigation|Ctrl+K|Navigate up (nvim split / herdr pane)
Navigation|Ctrl+L|Navigate right (nvim split / herdr pane)
Neovim Resize|Ctrl+W H|Resize split left (-5 cols)
Neovim Resize|Ctrl+W J|Resize split down (-3 rows)
Neovim Resize|Ctrl+W K|Resize split up (+3 rows)
Neovim Resize|Ctrl+W L|Resize split right (+5 cols)
Neovim Reposition|Ctrl+W Left|Move split to far left
Neovim Reposition|Ctrl+W Down|Move split to bottom
Neovim Reposition|Ctrl+W Up|Move split to top
Neovim Reposition|Ctrl+W Right|Move split to far right
Neovim Splits|Ctrl+W S|Split horizontally
Neovim Splits|Ctrl+W V|Split vertically
Neovim Splits|Ctrl+W Q|Close split
Neovim Splits|Ctrl+W =|Equalize splits
Neovim Splits|Ctrl+W O|Close all other splits
Herdr Resize|prefix+h|Resize pane left
Herdr Resize|prefix+j|Resize pane down
Herdr Resize|prefix+k|Resize pane up
Herdr Resize|prefix+l|Resize pane right
Herdr Resize|prefix+r|Resize mode (hjkl, Esc to exit)
Herdr Splits|prefix+"|Split pane stacked (also prefix+-)
Herdr Splits|prefix+%|Split pane side by side (also prefix+v)
Herdr Splits|prefix+x|Close pane
Herdr Panes|prefix+Shift+hjkl|Swap pane with neighbor
Herdr Panes|prefix+Tab|Cycle to next pane
Herdr Panes|prefix+z|Toggle pane zoom
Herdr Panes|prefix+[|Copy mode
Herdr Panes|prefix+e|Open scrollback in $EDITOR
Herdr Tabs|prefix+c|New tab
Herdr Tabs|prefix+n|Next tab
Herdr Tabs|prefix+p|Previous tab
Herdr Tabs|prefix+<number>|Go to tab <number>
Herdr Tabs|prefix+&|Close tab (also prefix+Shift+x)
Herdr Tabs|prefix+Shift+t|Rename tab
Herdr Workspaces|prefix+w|Workspace picker
Herdr Workspaces|prefix+(|Previous workspace
Herdr Workspaces|prefix+)|Next workspace
Herdr Workspaces|prefix+Shift+1..9|Go to workspace 1-9
Herdr Workspaces|prefix+s|Session navigator (also prefix+g)
Herdr Workspaces|prefix+Shift+n|New workspace
Herdr Workspaces|prefix+Shift+w|Rename workspace
Herdr Workspaces|prefix+b|Toggle sidebar
Herdr Workspaces|prefix+q|Detach
Herdr Workspaces|prefix+Shift+r|Reload config
Herdr Workspaces|prefix+?|Show all herdr keybindings
